meta {
  name: Put Update Profile
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user/update_profile
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

body:json {
  {
    "telegram_user_id": "1234567890",
    "email": "tester@gmail.com",
    "username": "flazefy"
  }
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Put Update Profile

  This request is used to update user profile. The updated field are `email`, `username`, and `telegram_user_id`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, broadcast message with Telegram, and audited activity (history).

  ## Responses

  **200 — profile updated**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "profile updated"
  }
```

  **404 — telegram id failed to update**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "user not found"
  }
```

  **409 — username / email has been used**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "username or email has been used. try another"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}